@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - Crypto Trivia</PageTitle>

<div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-header">
        <h1>About Crypto Trivia</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Learn, Play, and Earn Tokens!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
        <div class="card info-card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>🎮 What is Crypto Trivia?</h2>
                <p>
                    Crypto Trivia is a blockchain-based trivia game inspired by the classic gameshow Jeopardy. 
                    Test your knowledge of cryptocurrency, blockchain technology, and Web3 while earning real ERC-20 tokens!
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card info-card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>💰 Earn Tokens</h2>
                <div class="reward-info">
                    <p><strong>Token:</strong> Arcade1870 (ERC-20)</p>
                    <p><strong>Contract Address:</strong> <code>0x8eddD4edea39c5B5f77662453600F53A202EE47C</code></p>
                    <p><strong>Reward Rate:</strong> 0.01 tokens per point</p>
                    <p>
                        Simply connect your MetaMask wallet, play the game, and earn tokens based on your score. 
                        All players receive rewards just for playing!
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card info-card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>🔐 MetaMask Integration</h2>
                <p>
                    Crypto Trivia uses MetaMask to connect to your Web3 wallet. This ensures:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>✓ Secure wallet connection without exposing private keys</li>
                    <li>✓ Direct token transfers to your wallet</li>
                    <li>✓ Full control over your assets</li>
                    <li>✓ Transparent blockchain-based rewards</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    <a href="https://metamask.io/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">
                        Download MetaMask
                    </a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card info-card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>📚 How to Play</h2>
                <ol>
                    <li><strong>Connect your wallet:</strong> Click the "Connect MetaMask" button</li>
                    <li><strong>Start the game:</strong> Click "START GAME" to begin</li>
                    <li><strong>Select questions:</strong> Choose from 5 categories with questions valued $100-$500</li>
                    <li><strong>Answer questions:</strong> Reveal the answer and indicate if you got it right</li>
                    <li><strong>Earn rewards:</strong> After all questions are answered, claim your tokens!</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card info-card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>📖 Game Categories</h2>
                <div class="categories-info">
                    <div class="category-info">
                        <h5>🪙 Bitcoin Basics</h5>
                        <p>Learn about Bitcoin's history, supply, and fundamentals</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-info">
                        <h5>⚡ Ethereum Essentials</h5>
                        <p>Master Ethereum, smart contracts, and token standards</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-info">
                        <h5>🔗 Blockchain Technology</h5>
                        <p>Understand the core concepts of blockchain</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-info">
                        <h5>💳 Wallets & Transactions</h5>
                        <p>Learn about wallet security and blockchain transactions</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="category-info">
                        <h5>🏦 DeFi & Web3</h5>
                        <p>Explore Decentralized Finance and Web3</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card info-card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>⚠️ Important Notes</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>You must have MetaMask installed and configured to play</li>
                    <li>Ensure you're on a supported network (Ethereum Mainnet, Sepolia, or Polygon)</li>
                    <li>Token transfers require network gas fees (usually very small)</li>
                    <li>Have fun and learn about cryptocurrency while playing!</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-section">
            <a href="/game" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                🚀 Start Playing Now 🚀
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
